			"notes": "## [1.2.0] - Matching Minecraft versions and automatic releases\n\n### Added\n- Fabric/NeoForge 26.3, 26.1.2, 1.21.8 and 1.21.1, and Fabric/Forge 1.20.1 alongside 1.21.11.\n- Automatic GitHub/Modrinth releases on a successful new-version push to `main`.\n\n### Fixed\n- Resource-pack metadata now declares the actual game format for each target.\n\n### Changed\n- All twelve jars include their Minecraft version in the filename and share the root mod version.\n- Build with Java 25; Minecraft 1.20.1 retains Java 17, 1.21.x Java 21, and 26.x uses Java 25.\n- Existing config, homes and warps remain compatible across the version ports."
		},
